! xmodmap for HackHaste Left Shift Lock. For ancient X11 without working XKB.
! Usage: xmodmap xmodmap.haha-left-shiftlock
! Caps Lock is remapped to Control_L; physical Left Ctrl is Caps_Lock.

! Physical Left Ctrl (X11 keycode 37) is Shift_Lock (all keys).
! xmodmap cannot latch Shift the way XKB does; this at least
! takes the key out of Control and onto Shift.

